| VM            | Hostname       | IP              |
| ------------- | -------------- | --------------- |
| Control Plane | `controlplane` | `192.168.56.10` |
| Worker 1      | `node01`       | `192.168.56.11` |
| Worker 2      | `node02`       | `192.168.56.12` |

Operating System:

```text
Ubuntu 24.04
```

Container Runtime:

```text
containerd
```

Kubernetes Networking:

```text
Flannel
```

