# 1. Create the Project

On your Mac:

```bash
mkdir -p teleport-k8s-demo/manifests
cd teleport-k8s-demo
```

The finished project will look like:

```text
teleport-k8s-demo/
├── Vagrantfile
├── README.md
└── manifests/
    ├── nginx-user-csr.yaml
    ├── nginx-rbac.yaml
    ├── cluster-issuer.yaml
    ├── nginx-deployment.yaml
    ├── nginx-service.yaml
    ├── nginx-certificate.yaml
    └── nginx-ingress.yaml
```

---

# 2. Create the Vagrantfile

On your Mac:

```bash
cat <<'EOF' > Vagrantfile
Vagrant.configure("2") do |config|

  config.vm.box = "ubuntu/noble64"

  config.vm.provider "virtualbox" do |vb|
    vb.memory = "4096"
    vb.cpus = 2
  end

  config.vm.define "controlplane" do |cp|
    cp.vm.hostname = "controlplane"
    cp.vm.network "private_network", ip: "192.168.56.10"

    cp.vm.provider "virtualbox" do |vb|
      vb.name = "controlplane"
    end
  end

  config.vm.define "node01" do |node|
    node.vm.hostname = "node01"
    node.vm.network "private_network", ip: "192.168.56.11"

    node.vm.provider "virtualbox" do |vb|
      vb.name = "node01"
    end
  end

  config.vm.define "node02" do |node|
    node.vm.hostname = "node02"
    node.vm.network "private_network", ip: "192.168.56.12"

    node.vm.provider "virtualbox" do |vb|
      vb.name = "node02"
    end
  end

end
EOF
```

Start the machines:

```bash
vagrant up
```

Verify:

```bash
vagrant status
```

Expected:

```text
controlplane   running
node01         running
node02         running
```

