# 13. Initialize the Kubernetes Control Plane

From this point forward, commands are run on:

```text
controlplane
```

unless otherwise stated.

SSH:

```bash
vagrant ssh controlplane
```

Initialize Kubernetes:

```bash
sudo kubeadm init \
  --apiserver-advertise-address=192.168.56.10 \
  --pod-network-cidr=10.244.0.0/16
```

The first critical option is:

```text
--apiserver-advertise-address=192.168.56.10
```

This prevents the API server from advertising:

```text
10.0.2.15
```

The second is:

```text
--pod-network-cidr=10.244.0.0/16
```

which matches the Flannel network.

