# 29. Extract the Kubernetes User Certificate

Run:

```bash
kubectl get csr nginx-user \
  -o jsonpath='{.status.certificate}' \
  | base64 -d \
  > nginx-user.crt
```

Verify:

```bash
openssl x509 \
  -in nginx-user.crt \
  -noout \
  -subject \
  -issuer
```

